{"id":"wb-3-89","name":"东阳卢宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东阳卢宅","text":"东阳卢宅位于中国浙江省东阳市城东，为卢氏民居建筑群，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n卢氏于南宋定居此处，明永乐年间卢睿中进士后家族逐渐兴旺，陆续兴建形成这一规模宏大的宅第。卢宅以卢氏大宗祠为中心，复荆堂、肃雍堂、树德堂三大宗支建筑群位于其周围，总占地25000余平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E9%98%B3%E5%8D%A2%E5%AE%85","revisionId":93938938,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93938938","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f44435b8813e4c6eb82d44fb.jpg","title":"20260731_Residence_of_the_Lu_Family_in_Dongyang_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260731_Residence_of_the_Lu_Family_in_Dongyang_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/20260731_Residence_of_the_Lu_Family_in_Dongyang_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​东阳卢宅 风纪世家坊","width":320,"height":213}}